;HLA_A2.1 heavy chain noncovalently associated to a
beta-2-microglobulin subunit (light chain). Heavy chain
is made of three subunits alpha1, alpha2 and alpha3. Peptide
binds to the groove formed by the alpha1 and alpha2 domains.
